{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id949661933"}, "name":{"label":"DAXTYN BARNES"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-18T17:19:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.17.3"}, "id":{"label":"14566238680"}, "title":{"label":"This is honestly a great app!"}, "content":{"label":"This is honestly a really good app for tracking your habits and even though you’re only limited to three habits for free, The price of the pro subscription makes it’s seriously more than worth the $2.99 per month if you use this app a lot and nice that it also offers a lifetime of pro of only $49.99 with i would say would definitely really worth it if you use this app a lot.\n\nBut overall, It’s a nice app as it has a lot of good features and the pro subscription is not expensive which makes it super worth it honestly in my opinion.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
